    "summary": "Spec 44 step 2, first part (split under cascade #841's standing rule; the split is recorded in the spec). This adds `content/scenarios/`, the named scenarios the capture will play and the bench will time. Each scenario is one FormationRecord, and `scenarios.json` names its map and the behaviours it must show. The crate reads the list (`native/rust/src/scenarios.rs`). `Replay` plays a scenario on the field until it ends (a side stops standing after contact, plus TAIL; or 90 s). `scenarios/seen.rs` reads what it shows: fording, flanking, engaging, breaking off, cornering and routing.",
